    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Jinetes de rajadáctilo" hidden="false" id="29dd-d95f-3d4a-5d4" publicationId="e9d0-a23-6a15-1fcb">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Jinetes de rajadáctilo" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="5857-57da-55ba-a466">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">14&quot;</characteristic>
